{
  "$comment": "Pins for the on-demand fallback fonts in community/fallback-fonts. scripts/import-fallback-fonts.ts reads each upstream file from a sparse clone of google/fonts at `commit`, refuses a file whose sha256 differs from the pin, pins the width axis at its default, cuts the Latin, Greek and Cyrillic packs out of Noto Sans by script, and writes WOFF2 files, the licence texts and index.json. `scripts` are ISO 15924 codes: a pack fills characters of those scripts that a design system's fonts cannot draw. `version` is the upstream font version in the catalog's three-part grammar (2.012 becomes 2.12.0).",
